  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一款 Serilum 模組。用心製作。眾多適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">瓶裝空氣（Bottled Air）是一款能讓你在水下待更久的模組。除了藥水和海靈核心，你現在還可以從空玻璃瓶中吸取空氣。只要在水面游泳且空氣氣泡條可見時，對著空瓶按右鍵即可。此動作預設會補充玩家一半的空氣氣泡。<br><br>為了避免過程中你的背包被水瓶塞滿，你可以在非慣用手持有其中一種火焰類物品。目前火焰類方塊有 <em><strong>營火、火焰彈、熔岩桶和岩漿塊</strong></em>。持有這些方塊時，新生成的水瓶會蒸發，而你會取回玻璃瓶。預設情況下，這個過程中有 50% 的機率玻璃瓶會破裂。去探索那個水下世界吧！</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum's QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>disableWaterConsumptionUnderwater</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，玩家將無法在水下飲用水瓶，以防止獲得無限氧氣。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>holdFireTypeItemInOffhandToPreventWaterBottleCreation</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在非慣用手持有火焰類方塊時防止水瓶生成（蒸發）。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>chanceGlassBottleBreaksWithFireTypeInOffhand</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 0.5，最小值 0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">在非慣用手物品蒸發水時，玻璃瓶破裂的機率，並歸還空的（空氣）瓶子。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>amountOfAirInBottles</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 150，最小值 0，最大值 1000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">一個空瓶內含的空氣量。在原版 Minecraft 中，300 是最大空氣供應量。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>跳入水中，從空瓶中吸取空氣，以便在水下游得更久：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bottled-air/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"518\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>每個玻璃瓶能補充一半的空氣氣泡。蒸發過程中有 50% 的機率瓶子會破裂：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bottled-air/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"518\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>當然，你不一定要持有火焰類方塊：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bottled-air/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，但前提是下載必須保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有模組的概覽和更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在這麼多獨立模組頁面上追蹤留言，因此已關閉留言功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若遇到問題、有想法、建議或其他事項，可以到 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
